{"seq":3,"slug":"candidate-count-budget","title":"各阶段候选数与延迟预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-ranking-serving/serving-topology/candidate-count-budget","wordCount":2706,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"各阶段候选数与延迟预算\">各阶段候选数与延迟预算</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>漏斗的每一层都要回答两个数：这一层吃掉多少候选、分到多少毫秒。这两个数不是独立调优出来的，它们被同一个约束绑在一起——单位时间内可用的总计算量。把一次请求想象成一笔固定预算：召回、粗排、精排、混排各领走一部分毫秒，而每一层内部，候选数乘以单条成本不能超过它领到的时间。</p>\n<p>形式上，若第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 层的候选数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、单条处理成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（含一次特征查询的均摊成本）、分配的延迟预算为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则必须满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⟹</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i \\cdot c_i \\le B_i \\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad n_i \\le \\frac{B_i}{c_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条不等式看上去平淡，却规定了整条链路的形状：<strong>候选数的削减，只能来自「单条成本上升」或「预算下降」，而预算在一轮请求里是守恒的</strong>。精排的单条成本比粗排高两到三个数量级，所以它的候选数必须比粗排低两到三个数量级，否则预算被击穿。这不是模型能力问题，而是算术问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>典型入参</th>\n<th>典型出参</th>\n<th>单条成本量级</th>\n<th>典型预算</th>\n<th>约束来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>召回（单路）</td>\n<td>全量索引</td>\n<td>200–500</td>\n<td>索引查询摊销</td>\n<td>10–25ms</td>\n<td>索引规模与并行度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并去重</td>\n<td>各路之和</td>\n<td>800–2000</td>\n<td>微秒级</td>\n<td>1–3ms</td>\n<td>内存与哈希开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粗排</td>\n<td>800–2000</td>\n<td>100–300</td>\n<td>20–80<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>10–20ms</td>\n<td>特征批量取 + 轻模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精排</td>\n<td>100–300</td>\n<td>100–300</td>\n<td>0.5–3ms</td>\n<td>25–60ms</td>\n<td>深度模型推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混排</td>\n<td>100–300</td>\n<td>20–50</td>\n<td>微秒级</td>\n<td>5–15ms</td>\n<td>全局约束与干预规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>首页</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>150–400ms</td>\n<td>用户可感知阈值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这两列的乘积关系决定了链路的基本参数。可以看到精排的 100–300 候选乘以 0.5–3ms，落在 50ms 到 900ms 之间——上限远超预算，因此<strong>精排的候选数往往是被预算反推出来的</strong>，而批量推理的批大小（batch size）与之强耦合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"候选数削减比例的边际收益\">候选数削减比例的边际收益</h2><p>既然精排是瓶颈，一个自然的想法是「粗排多留一点，别让好物被误杀」。这个方向确实有效，但它的收益是递减的，并且递减的位置可以量化。</p>\n<p>设精排从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个候选里选出最终首页、其效果指标为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。经验上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 增长呈对数形态：从 100 提到 200 的效果增益，明显小于从 50 提到 100；而从 200 提到 400 的增益，往往已经小于它带来的延迟代价。原因是召回与粗排本身已经过滤掉了绝大部分低相关候选，剩下的候选在质量上相当接近，多留的那些多半是同质竞争品。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(n) \\approx E_{\\max} - \\frac{k}{\\log n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程上判断「该不该扩候选数」的正确方法是<strong>做一次分层实验</strong>：把精排候选数从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 提到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，观察效果指标变化与 P99 变化，算边际收益比。这里的实验设计要与 AB 框架配合，见 <a href=\"../ab-experiment/shadow-canary\">影子流量与金丝雀排序</a>——候选数是一个天然的实验变量，且它的影响可以直接从排序结果观察。</p>\n<p>相反的错误更常见：<strong>为了压延迟而盲目砍候选数</strong>。候选数砍到某一阈值以下，粗排的误杀率会开始主导结果质量，表现为「搜索页里明显该出现的东西不见了」这类用户可感知的问题。这个阈值通常通过召回率评测（离线）加上线上缺失反馈监控（线上）共同确定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟预算的分配方法\">延迟预算的分配方法</h2><p>预算分配的核心难点是<strong>尾延迟的加法</strong>。如果各阶段 P99 彼此独立，那么端到端 P99 不等于各阶段 P99 之和——它介于「各阶段 P50 之和」与「各阶段 P99 之和」之间，具体取决于各阶段延迟的相关性。工程上有一条实用的近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><msub><mn>99</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≲</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mi>P</mi><msub><mn>50</mn><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><msub><mn>99</mn><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><msub><mn>50</mn><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P99_{total} \\lesssim \\sum_i P50_i + \\max_i (P99_i - P50_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≲</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4777em;vertical-align:-0.7277em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7277em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条近似背后的直觉是：大部分请求所有阶段都接近中位数，所以中位数是必经成本；而「所有阶段同时命中尾部」的概率极低，通常只有一个阶段拖尾。它给出两个可操作结论。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>给预算时应先加总各阶段的 P50 作为基线，再为最可能拖尾的阶段留尾部空间</strong>。哪一阶段最可能拖尾通常可由历史数据确定——对包含外部索引查询的召回、对包含大模型推理的精排，尾部方差天然更大。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>预算分配必须从端到端反推，而不是从阶段正推</strong>。先定用户体验阈值（例如「首屏 P99 不超过 300ms」），扣除网络与网关开销，得到排序服务的总预算；再自上而下切给各阶段；各阶段拿到额度后再决定候选数。反向推导的常见错误是各阶段各自「留足余量」，最后加总超出端到端预算，而没人负责发现这件事。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[端到端 P99 目标 300ms] --&gt; N[扣除网络/网关 40ms]&#10;  N --&gt; T[排序服务总预算 260ms]&#10;  T --&gt; R[召回阶段 60ms]&#10;  T --&gt; P[粗排 20ms]&#10;  T --&gt; F[精排 70ms]&#10;  T --&gt; M[混排 15ms]&#10;  T --&gt; B[缓冲与装配 45ms]&#10;  R --&gt; R1[单路硬超时 25ms]&#10;  F --&gt; F1[批大小上限 256]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[预留缓冲 50ms 不可挪用]\">graph TD\n  S[端到端 P99 目标 300ms] --&gt; N[扣除网络/网关 40ms]\n  N --&gt; T[排序服务总预算 260ms]\n  T --&gt; R[召回阶段 60ms]\n  T --&gt; P[粗排 20ms]\n  T --&gt; F[精排 70ms]\n  T --&gt; M[混排 15ms]\n  T --&gt; B[缓冲与装配 45ms]\n  R --&gt; R1[单路硬超时 25ms]\n  F --&gt; F1[批大小上限 256]\n  B --&gt; B1[预留缓冲 50ms 不可挪用]</pre><p>图中最后一项是容易被省略但极重要的一项：<strong>必须显式保留一个不可挪用的缓冲</strong>。它用于吸收序列化、连接建立、GC 等不计入任何阶段的固定开销。若把预算切到刚好等于各阶段之和，线上一定会超——因为那些开销真实存在却不在任何阶段的计时里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"候选数与批量的耦合\">候选数与批量的耦合</h2><p>精排把候选提交给模型服务时，候选数直接决定了批大小，而批大小同时影响延迟和成本，是一个需要单独对待的参数。</p>\n<p><strong>批越大，单条均摊成本越低</strong>，因为 GPU/CPU 的算子效率与固定开销被摊薄；但<strong>批越大，整体延迟也越高</strong>，因为请求必须等整批凑齐或整批算完。于是同一份候选数下，批大小选择是一个权衡点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>批大小</th>\n<th>单条成本</th>\n<th>整体延迟</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>小批（16–32）</td>\n<td>高（固定开销占比大）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>延迟敏感、候选少、有严格 deadline</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中批（64–128）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>通用默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大批（256–512）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>吞吐优先、可离线或准实时场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在排序服务里，一个常见的工程做法是<strong>按 deadline 动态定批</strong>：编排器根据剩余时间决定本批放多少候选进去。剩余时间充裕时用大批提升吞吐、降低成本；剩余时间紧张时拆成小批甚至单条，保证结果能及时返回。这个动态决策与第三章的降级链是同一套机制的两种表现——都是「在剩余预算内做交换」，见 <a href=\"../latency-resilience/deadline-budget\">全链路 deadline 与阶段超时</a>。（推理服务侧对这一权衡的原生支持是动态批处理：Triton 的 dynamic batcher 会在 scheduler 中把并发请求合成批，并通过 <code>max_queue_delay_microseconds</code> 让请求多等一会以凑更大的批——吞吐上升、延迟也上升，官方建议在延迟预算内逐步调大；来源：NVIDIA Triton Inference Server, &quot;Batcher&quot;, <a href=\"https://docs.nvidia.com/deeplearning/triton-inference-server/user-guide/docs/user_guide/batcher.html）\">https://docs.nvidia.com/deeplearning/triton-inference-server/user-guide/docs/user_guide/batcher.html）</a></p>\n<p><strong>批内延迟差异会造成超时误伤</strong>。如果一个批里有几条特别慢（如特征缺失触发了回退查询），整个批都会晚返回，而其中大部分本来很快的候选被连坐。缓解方式是把同一批内的候选按「预期耗时」分层，或对异常慢的候选做批内剔除。这属于实现细节，但它是「候选数预算看起来够、实际 P99 超标」的常见根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全链路预算的监控闭环\">全链路预算的监控闭环</h2><p>预算分配不是一次性的设计动作，它需要一套监控把「设计值」与「实际值」持续对比。至少要观测四类指标。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段耗时分布</strong>：每一阶段的 P50/P90/P99 单独打点，而不是只打端到端。只在端到端打点会在超时发生时无法定位是哪一段造成的。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段进出候选数</strong>：每层进入多少、输出多少。它能同时暴露预算问题与召回质量问题——比如粗排输出突然从 300 掉到 120，可能是粗排模型异常或特征缺失导致的分数退化。</p>\n<p><strong>预算利用率</strong>：实际耗时除以分配预算。长期低于 50% 说明预算给多了，可以回收给候选数或给缓冲；长期高于 90% 则说明没有余量，任何抖动都会引发超时。（Google SRE 的过载处理原则与此一致：容量应按资源（如 CPU 成本）而非 QPS 度量，并在过载时先丢弃低优先级流量、主动降级而非让延迟崩塌；来源：Google SRE Book, &quot;Handling Overload&quot;, <a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/handling-overload/）\">https://sre.google/sre-book/handling-overload/）</a></p>\n<p><strong>超时与降级次数分级计数</strong>：按「哪一阶段超时」分别计数，而不是笼统记一个 fallback 计数。这直接决定了降级链的哪一级被实际使用——如果一级降级（精排超时）频繁触发，说明精排预算或候选数需要调整，而不是去优化二级降级。</p>\n<p>这四类指标构成一个闭环：候选数与批大小是输入，阶段耗时与预算利用率是过程，降级计数是结果。只有把三者放在一起看，才能判断「该扩候选数还是该削候选数」。这三类指标的采集与告警应当纳入服务通用的分级降级监控体系，而不是另建一套孤立的看板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>候选数与延迟预算由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i \\cdot c_i \\le B_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 绑定：单条成本越高的阶段，候选数必须越低，这是算术约束而非调优偏好。</li>\n<li>精排候选数通常由预算反推，且批量（batch size）与之强耦合；小批延迟低、大批成本低，按剩余 deadline 动态定批是通用解法。</li>\n<li>候选数扩展的边际收益随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 呈对数递减，扩候选数前应先做分层实验量化边际收益比；反向错误（盲目削候选）会让粗排误杀主导结果质量。</li>\n<li>端到端 P99 约等于「各阶段 P50 之和 + 最可能拖尾阶段的尾部增量」，因此预算必须从端到端反推，并且显式保留不可挪用的缓冲。</li>\n<li>监控必须分阶段打点：阶段耗时分布、阶段进出候选数、预算利用率、按阶段分类的超时降级计数，四者合起来才能指导参数调整。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"各阶段候选数与延迟预算","id":"各阶段候选数与延迟预算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"候选数削减比例的边际收益","id":"候选数削减比例的边际收益"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟预算的分配方法","id":"延迟预算的分配方法"},{"level":2,"text":"候选数与批量的耦合","id":"候选数与批量的耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"全链路预算的监控闭环","id":"全链路预算的监控闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多路召回扇出与并行编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-ranking-serving/serving-topology/fanout-parallel"},"next":{"title":"用户、商品与上下文特征的在线获取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-ranking-serving/online-features/feature-fetch"}}